  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bina Regional Arrangements for Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity provides grant funding support to the Ministry of Fisheries and Marine Resources to engage with the customary owners of the land, sea and harbour at Bina Harbour in Malaita, Solomon Islands. The scope of work includes capacity building for trustees and beneficiaries,&#xA0;governance arrangements,&#xA0;technical analyses and stakeholder engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
